    "Fixed computer science persona with novice domain, statistics, and coding expertise; other persona attributes use neutral defaults.",
    "Models, iteration budgets, approved study facts, and grading contracts match the baseline. Cases run concurrently."
  ],
  "actor_python_overrides": {
